---
pagination:
  data: catalogVolumes
  size: 1
  alias: item
permalink: "/textbooks/{{ item.edition }}/grade-{{ item.grade }}/volume-{{ item.volume }}/"
layout: layouts/base.njk
eleventyComputed:
  title: "{{ item.name }}{{ item.grade }}年级数学{{ '上册' if item.volume == 1 else '下册' }}课件"
  description: "{{ item.name }}{{ item.grade }}年级数学{{ '上册' if item.volume == 1 else '下册' }}同步课件目录。"
---
<p><a href="/textbooks/{{ item.edition }}/">{{ item.name }}</a> / <a href="/textbooks/{{ item.edition }}/grade-{{ item.grade }}/">{{ item.grade }}年级</a></p>
<h1>{{ item.name }}{{ item.grade }}年级数学{{ "上册" if item.volume == 1 else "下册" }}</h1>
<p>以下资源均为已发布课件，具体单元与课时以实际教材版次为准。</p>
<div class="cards">{% for course in courses %}{% if course.edition == item.edition and course.grade == item.grade and course.volume == item.volume %}<a class="card" href="/courses/{{ course.slug }}/"><h2>{{ course.title }}</h2><p>查看课件详情</p></a>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>
